GUMBALL OUTPUTS

Every asset the machine dispenses is licensed to the recipient and the public
as CC0-1.0 (public domain) via its receipt, regardless of the generator used.
Receipts are machine-readable JSON and live in outputs/receipts.jsonl and in
the public assets archive. The underlying open-source models used
(FLUX.1-schnell: Apache-2.0, TRELLIS/TRELLIS.2: MIT, ACE-Step: Apache-2.0)
impose no restrictions on outputs, which is why CC0 dedication is possible.
See docs/license-audit.md for the full per-generator audit.
